      "writtenOn": "2016-04-14T21:18:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We may want more assertions than these. \noffset \u003c max_offset, size \u003c max_offset, offset \u003c max_offset - size, etc. Dealing with unsigned values is tricky, since the compiler may silently discard things it considers \"impossible\", like integer overflow. It depends on where the parameters ultimately come from.\n\nSame for nvmem_write() too, so maybe put these checks into a common function.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 168,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 168,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "b4150577487584e995f3f41e16b0a3300b7e5a6e",
